      "side": 1,
      "message": "nit: `to_string()` is not necessary for `split()`.\n\nYou can also rewrite this to be more rust idiomatic way:\n\n```\nlet start \u003d slice\n  .split(\" \")\n  .fold(0, |acc, s| if acc + s.len() + 1 \u003e pos { acc } else { acc + s.len() + 1 });\n\n```",
      "range": {
